# T3-Payruns/Payruns-March-Biweekly.pecmd
#
# Runs biweekly payruns from Jan 26 through Mar 22 2026.
# Called by Setup.cmd after Payruns-January.pecmd.
#
# Includes:
#   - Jessica Torres March bonus ($10,000 supplemental wages)
#     case value import (processed before payrun execution)
#   - 4 biweekly periods covering all 6 biweekly employees
#     (pay date = period end + 5 days, Friday):
#       P2: Jan 26 – Feb 8   paid Feb 13
#       P3: Feb 9  – Feb 22  paid Feb 27
#       P4: Feb 23 – Mar 8   paid Mar 13
#       P5: Mar 9  – Mar 22  paid Mar 27  ← Jessica bonus period
# ============================================================

PayrollImport Payruns-March-Biweekly.json
